      <Placemark>
        <name>NRMA Fast Charger Berri</name>
        <description><![CDATA[Please be advised that we are currently experiencing a technical issue that has temporarily reduced the charging power at our stations. We are working diligently to resolve the issue as quickly as possible. In the meantime, please note the following adjustments:<br>Berri #1: Charging power is limited to 75kW<br>Berri #2: Charging power is limited to 25W<br><br>We apologise for any inconvenience this may cause and appreciate your understanding and patience as we work to restore full charging capacity.<br><br>Thank you for your cooperation.<br><br>Located inside carpark (Cnr Gilbert & Ahern Streets)<br><br>Download the app for real-time status updates, charger details and pricing information.<br><br>Quarter: ]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
